# Experimental W4A8G32 SM8750/V79 profiling contract.
#
# This file is intentionally a shell fragment with no command substitution.
# Host paths are resolved from ARTIFACT_ROOT by the profiling script; these
# values are repository-relative or models-relative so the whole llm_exp tree
# can be moved to another VM/WSL installation without editing the contract.

